nd China routes.</p></div></div></a><div class="x7yt7bq"><a class="xv9tkel" href="/vocom-services"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/vocom-international-15f76d.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/vocom-international-15f76d-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/vocom-international-15f76d-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/vocom-international-15f76d.jpg 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="1920" height="1280" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div class="p2 xlxn3qc"><div class="xo4ml8w"><p class="xx7nktr">Fiber Optic Cables</p><p class="x2ad7rc">Tier-1 sourced outside-plant and indoor fiber optic cable, delivered build-to-order in 6 to 8 weeks standard, up to 10 weeks for high-count or custom builds.</p></div></div></a><a class="xv9tkel" href="/vocom-services"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/vocom-international-dd153d.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/vocom-international-dd153d-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/vocom-international-dd153d-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/vocom-international-dd153d.jpg 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="1920" height="1282" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div class="p2 xlxn3qc"><div class="xo4ml8w"><p class="xx7nktr">Mobile Data and eSIM</p><p class="x2ad7rc">A global eSIM storefront at ezsim.com, plus Vocom’s T-Mobile MVNO service in the US and MNO status in Canada.</p></div></div></a><a class="xv9tkel" href="/vocom-services"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/vocom-international-74f851.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/vocom-international-74f851-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/vocom-international-74f851-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/vocom-international-74f851.jpg 1080w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="1080" height="1080" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div class="p2 xlxn3qc"><div class="xo4ml8w"><p class="xx7nktr">AI Server Business</p><p class="x2ad7rc">Authorized Supermicro reseller, deploying AI-ready compute inside Vocom’s own carrier-neutral data centers.</p></div></div></a><a class="xv9tkel" href="/vocom-services"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/vocom-international-b5a705.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/vocom-international-b5a705-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/vocom-international-b5a705-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/vocom-international-b5a705.jpg 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="1920" height="960" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div class="p2 xlxn3qc"><div class="xo4ml8w"><p class="xx7nktr">Global System Integration</p><p class="x2ad7rc">Consulting, procurement, logistics, installation and troubleshooting for overseas network deployments, end to end.</p></div></div></a></div><a class="xg6he0s" href="/vocom-services"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/vocom-international-cc0050.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/vocom-international-cc0050-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/vocom-international-cc0050-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/vocom-international-cc0050.jpg 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="1920" height="1280" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div class="p2 xlxn3qc"><div class="xo4ml8w"><p class="xx7nktr">24/7 NOC Monitoring</p><p class="x2ad7rc">The same network operations center watches every business line, from voice routes to AI compute.</p></div></div></a><a class="x8nee5a" href="/vocom-services"><img class="fill-img" src="/assets/img/vocom-international-3ff171.jpg" srcset="/assets/img/vocom-international-3ff171-512w.webp 512w, /assets/img/vocom-international-3ff171-1024w.webp 1024w, /assets/img/vocom-international-3ff171.jpg 1920w" sizes="(min-width: 810px) and (max-width: 1199.98px) 100vw, (max-width: 809.98px) 100vw, 100vw" width="1920" height="1280" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><div class="p2 xlxn3qc"><div class="xo4ml8w"