-Pacific, Europe and EMEA, and North and South America, with particular strength across the Pacific.</FaqItem></div><div class="faq-accordian-item-2 xzkh4c6"><FaqItem question="Do you supply wholesale fiber optic cable internationally?">Yes. Vocom International supplies wholesale, build-to-order fiber optic cable for telecommunications, infrastructure and data center projects worldwide, alongside its carrier services.</FaqItem></div></div></div><div class="simple-footer-2 xzxrxrs footer-slot" data-pagefind-ignore><Footer footerTagline="Your partner for telecommunications and fiber optic supply." title="Quick Links" menu1="VOCOM AI" menu2="Services" menu3="RenOS AI Agents" link2="/vocom-services" link3="/vocom-ai-agents" /></div></div>
